---
/* About — light-only editorial reading on the new system (Shell + landing
   tokens). Every colour and type size resolves to a tokens.css variable —
   no raw hex, rgb, or font sizes live in this file. The alternating
   light/dark rhythm was removed: one white page throughout (round 1). */
import Shell from '../layouts/Shell.astro';
---

<Shell
  title="About — Basit Masood"
  description="The person behind the products. From a village in Pakistan to designing fintech for millions."
  active="about"
>

<!-- ════ HERO — photo + bound monument column (production grammar, monument-scaled) ════ -->
<section class="ab-hero">
  <div class="ab-hero-inner">
    <div class="ab-photo-col reveal">
      <img src="/images/abm.jpg" alt="Basit Masood" class="ab-photo" />
    </div>
    <div class="ab-hero-text reveal" style="transition-delay:120ms">
      <p class="ab-kicker"><span class="ab-kicker-rule"></span>About</p>
      <h1 class="ab-hero-title"><span class="ab-hl">The person behind</span><span class="ab-hl">the products<em>.</em></span></h1>
      <div class="ab-intro-col">
        <p class="ab-intro">I'm Basit. I design products that move money for millions of people. But if you asked my family back in a small village in Pakistan, they'd say I'm the one who left and ended up staring at screens all day.</p>
        <p class="ab-intro">They're not entirely wrong.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ STORY — origin ════ -->
<section class="ab-story">
  <div class="ab-story-inner">
    <div class="ab-story-text reveal">
      <p>I grew up in a village in rural Pakistan. My family had a small piece of agricultural land — pomegranate trees, guava, shah toot berries. We grew wheat and fruit, just enough for ourselves.</p>
      <p>I studied computer science, graduated, and started working as a software engineer. But something kept bothering me — nobody could explain <em>why</em> we were building any of it.</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="ab-pullquote reveal" id="pullquote">
      <span class="ab-pullquote-mark">"</span>
      <span class="pq-word">Why</span> <span class="pq-word">are</span> <span class="pq-word">we</span> <span class="pq-word">building</span> <span class="pq-word">this?</span>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="ab-story-text reveal">
      <p>That question pulled me into design. Not the pixels. Not the tools. The why.</p>
      <p>Eight years later, that same question has followed me from SadaPay to ADIB to ZAR — into arguments with central banks and product debates with CEOs — that turned into products used by millions. Most recently, I built an AI-native design system where engineers now prototype without designers, using tools I created.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ab-story-text reveal">
      <p>Some of those chapters ended on my terms. Some didn't. I'd choose every one of them again.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ BELIEFS ════ -->
<section class="ab-lens">
  <div class="ab-lens-inner">
    <aside class="ab-lens-aside">
      <h2 class="ab-lens-heading reveal">THINGS<br/>I BELIEVE</h2>
    </aside>
    <div class="ab-beliefs-col">
      <div class="ab-beliefs reveal-stagger">
        <div class="ab-belief reveal-child">
          <h3 class="ab-belief-title">Intuitive<em>.</em></h3>
          <p class="ab-belief-text">If someone has to think about how to use it, I failed. The interface should feel inevitable, like it couldn't have been any other way.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief reveal-child">
          <h3 class="ab-belief-title">Simple<em>.</em></h3>
          <p class="ab-belief-text">One screen, one job. No ambiguity. No clever tricks that need explaining.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief reveal-child">
          <h3 class="ab-belief-title">Distinct<em>.</em></h3>
          <p class="ab-belief-text">If it looks like everyone else's product, it will be treated like everyone else's product.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="ab-belief reveal-child">
          <h3 class="ab-belief-title">Hire hunger<em>.</em></h3>
          <p class="ab-belief-text">Passion, curiosity, drive. Taste comes with time. Those three don't.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ab-belief-coda reveal">MLP, not MVP. Someone already solves this problem — you have to solve it better.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ CINEMATIC BREAK ════ -->
<div class="ab-bleed-img" id="bleedImg">
  <img src="/images/about-bleed.jpg" alt="Highway through the green hills of the Cameron Highlands, Malaysia" loading="lazy" />
  <div class="ab-bleed-overlay"></div>
  <span class="ab-loc ab-loc--bleed"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Cameron Highlands, Malaysia</span>
</div>

<!-- ════ PEOPLE FIRST — leadership ════ -->
<section class="ab-how">
  <div class="ab-how-inner">
    <h2 class="ab-how-heading reveal">PEOPLE FIRST.<br/>ALWAYS.</h2>
    <div class="ab-how-grid">
      <div class="ab-how-block reveal">
        <p>When someone on my team is struggling, I don't start with feedback. I cover for them — quietly — so the product and the team don't suffer while we figure it out.</p>
        <p>Then I have the real conversation. Not in a meeting room. Over chai, casually. <em>"What's actually going on?"</em> There's always a reason. Nobody loses their talent overnight.</p>
        <p>I give people time. A month, sometimes two. And if it still doesn't work, I make the call. I've let people go. Empathy and hard decisions are not opposites — one just makes the other more honest.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-how-block reveal" style="transition-delay:100ms">
        <p>If something doesn't make sense for the user, I challenge it — regardless of who proposed it.</p>
        <p>Most of the designers I hired at SadaPay came straight from university with messy portfolios and no experience. I saw something in them.</p>
        <p class="ab-how-accent">Some of them are now senior designers at Revolut. That's the work I'm most proud of — not the products, the people.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ BEYOND THE SCREEN — personal ════ -->
<section class="ab-personal">
  <div class="ab-personal-inner">
    <div class="ab-personal-lead reveal">
      <p class="ab-personal-label">Beyond the screen</p>
      <p class="ab-kharoos">That pull toward nature never left me. It turned into an obsession with finding the places most people never reach.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="ab-personal-split" id="travelSplit">
      <div class="ab-personal-text-col">
        <p class="reveal">In university I didn't have the money to travel, but I knew Pakistan held a gem of places I needed to see. So I did my research — found places that are hard to reach, where you take a bus, then switch to a 4x4 jeep, then hike or camp. Places between snow-capped peaks with cold deserts and waterfalls that don't look real. I had zero experience. I planned everything from scratch.</p>
        <p class="reveal">I started a small adventure club called <strong>Travelogue.</strong> I'd plan the whole trip, post an ad, calculate per-head budgets, book the coaster. Everyone paid their share. I went for free. But I had to earn that — so I offered two things no agency did: free photography for every trip, and my own chef who cooked homemade food on the road.</p>
        <p class="reveal">That curiosity never stopped. I lived in Malaysia for a year as a digital nomad, working remotely from SadaPay, then six months in Bali. Always the places fewer people visit, always on foot.</p>
        <p class="reveal">I can't do work I'm not passionate about. Not won't — <em>can't.</em> I lose all energy for it. My career shows it. Every role has been a deliberate choice.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ab-sticky-carousel reveal">
        <div class="ab-carousel" id="travelCarousel">
          <div class="ab-carousel-track" id="carouselTrack">
            <div class="ab-slide active">
              <img src="/images/about-carousel-0.jpg" alt="Natural pool overlooking the jungle in Bali" loading="lazy" class="ab-carousel-img" />
              <span class="ab-loc"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Bali, Indonesia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ab-slide">
              <img src="/images/about-carousel-3.jpg" alt="Kelingking beach cliff in Nusa Penida, Bali" loading="lazy" class="ab-carousel-img" />
              <span class="ab-loc"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Nusa Penida, Indonesia</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ab-slide">
              <img src="/images/about-carousel-6.jpg" alt="Passu Cones rising over the Karakoram Highway" loading="lazy" class="ab-carousel-img" style="object-position:top" />
              <span class="ab-loc"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Passu Cones, Gilgit-Baltistan</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ab-slide">
              <img src="/images/about-carousel-7.jpg" alt="Pine tree road in Kahuta, Pakistan" loading="lazy" class="ab-carousel-img" />
              <span class="ab-loc"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Kahuta, Pakistan</span>
            </div>
            <div class="ab-slide">
              <img src="/images/about-carousel-8.jpg" alt="Snorkeling in the clear water of the Blue Lagoon, Bali" loading="lazy" class="ab-carousel-img" />
              <span class="ab-loc"><svg class="ab-loc-pin" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 14s4.5-3.8 4.5-8A4.5 4.5 0 0 0 8 1.5 4.5 4.5 0 0 0 3.5 6c0 4.2 4.5 8 4.5 8z"/><circle cx="8" cy="6" r="1.6"/></svg>Blue Lagoon, Bali</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-carousel-controls">
            <button class="ab-carousel-btn" id="carouselPrev" aria-label="Previous image">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 4L6 8l4 4"/></svg>
            </button>
            <button class="ab-carousel-btn" id="carouselNext" aria-label="Next image">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M6 4l4 4-4 4"/></svg>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ ENDING ════ -->
<div class="ab-ending">
  <p class="ab-ending-text reveal">Still asking why.</p>
</div>

<style>
  /* ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
     ABOUT — light-only editorial reading. Every colour and type
     size resolves to a token from /landing/css/tokens.css; no raw
     hex, rgb, or font sizes live here. White page throughout —
     the alternating dark rhythm was removed (Basit, round 1).
     ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */

  /* ══ HERO — photo + bound monument column (eyebrow→headline→intro share one
     left edge beside the portrait; monument scaled to the side column) ══ */
  .ab-hero{ min-height:100svh; display:flex; align-items:center; padding:var(--sp-sec-top) var(--gutter) var(--sp-sec-bot); background:var(--paper); }
  .ab-hero-inner{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:72px; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; width:100%; }
  .ab-photo-col{ flex-shrink:0; position:relative; }
  .ab-photo{ width:340px; height:420px; object-fit:cover; border-radius:var(--r); position:relative; z-index:1; }
  .ab-photo-col::before{ content:''; position:absolute; left:-16px; top:32px; bottom:32px; width:var(--stroke); background:var(--red); border-radius:1px; }
  .ab-hero-text{ flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .ab-kicker{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; font-family:var(--sans); font-size:var(--fs-label); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink-50); margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ab-kicker-rule{ width:40px; height:var(--hairline); background:var(--ink-25); display:inline-block; }
  .ab-hero-title{ font-family:var(--display); text-transform:uppercase; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,64px); line-height:.92; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:28px; }
  .ab-hl{ display:block; }
  .ab-hero-title em{ font-style:normal; color:var(--red); }
  .ab-intro{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.7; color:var(--ink-65); max-width:480px; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .ab-intro:first-child{ color:var(--ink-80); }
  .ab-intro:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }

  /* ══ STORY (light) — left-aligned to the same 1100 grid line as the hero,
     section headings and photo; reading measure widened from 720 → 860 ══ */
  .ab-story{ background:var(--paper); padding:var(--sp-sec-bot) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-story-inner{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ab-story-text{ max-width:none; }
  .ab-story-text p{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.8; color:var(--ink-80); margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ab-story-text p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .ab-story-text em{ color:var(--ink); font-style:italic; }
  .ab-story-text + .ab-story-text{ margin-top:24px; }

  .ab-pullquote{
    margin:56px 0; padding:44px 0 0; position:relative;
    font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-serif-md); font-weight:400; font-style:italic;
    line-height:1.3; color:var(--ink); max-width:none;
  }
  .ab-pullquote-mark{
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--fs-quote-mark); font-weight:400; color:var(--red); line-height:.4;
    position:absolute; left:0; top:8px;
  }
  .pq-word{ opacity:.14; transition:opacity var(--t-fill) var(--ease); }
  .pq-word.pq-visible{ opacity:1; }

  /* ══ BELIEFS — sticky editorial spread: heading pins left, beliefs scroll
     past on the right. Titles use the site's signature OUTLINED→FILL move. ══ */
  .ab-lens{ background:var(--paper); padding:var(--sp-sec-bot) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-lens-inner{ display:flex; align-items:flex-start; gap:88px; max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ab-lens-aside{ flex:0 0 300px; position:sticky; top:120px; }
  .ab-lens-heading{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--fs-display-md); font-weight:400; line-height:.9; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink); }
  .ab-beliefs-col{ flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .ab-beliefs{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:64px; }
  /* beliefs stay put; the outline→fill IS the entrance motion (not an opacity fade) */
  .ab-belief.reveal-child{ opacity:1; transform:none; }
  .ab-belief-title{
    font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--fs-display-md); font-weight:400;
    line-height:.95; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:14px;
    color:transparent; -webkit-text-stroke:var(--stroke) var(--ink);
    transition:color var(--t-fill) var(--ease) .12s, -webkit-text-stroke-color var(--t-fill) var(--ease) .12s;
  }
  .ab-belief.revealed .ab-belief-title{ color:var(--ink); -webkit-text-stroke-color:transparent; }
  .ab-belief-title em{ font-style:normal; color:var(--red); -webkit-text-stroke:0; }
  .ab-belief-text{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.6; color:var(--ink-65); max-width:54ch; }
  .ab-belief-coda{
    font-family:var(--serif); font-style:italic; font-size:var(--fs-serif-md); font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.4; color:var(--ink); text-align:left; max-width:54ch; margin:0; padding:72px 0 0;
  }

  /* ══ FULL-BLEED BREAK ══ */
  .ab-bleed-img{ width:100%; height:70vh; min-height:420px; position:relative; overflow:hidden; }
  .ab-bleed-img img{ width:100%; height:120%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center 82%; will-change:transform; }
  .ab-bleed-overlay{ position:absolute; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--paper) 0%, transparent 15%, transparent 85%, var(--paper) 100%); }

  /* ══ PEOPLE FIRST (light) ══ */
  .ab-how{ background:var(--paper); padding:var(--sp-sec-bot) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-how-inner{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ab-how-heading{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--fs-display-xl); font-weight:400; line-height:.92; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:64px; }
  .ab-how-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; }
  .ab-how-block p{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.8; color:var(--ink-80); margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ab-how-block p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .ab-how-block em{ color:var(--ink); font-style:italic; }
  .ab-how-accent{ color:var(--ink); font-weight:500; padding-left:24px; border-left:var(--stroke) solid var(--red); }

  /* ══ BEYOND THE SCREEN (light) ══ */
  .ab-personal{ background:var(--paper); padding:var(--sp-sec-bot) var(--gutter); }
  .ab-personal-inner{ max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
  .ab-personal-lead{ max-width:720px; margin-bottom:64px; }
  .ab-personal-label{ font-family:var(--display); font-size:var(--fs-display-md); font-weight:400; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:24px; line-height:1; }
  .ab-kharoos{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.7; color:var(--ink); }
  .ab-kharoos em{ font-style:italic; }

  .ab-personal-split{ display:flex; gap:64px; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:64px; }
  .ab-personal-text-col{ flex:1; min-width:0; }
  .ab-personal-text-col p{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-body-lg); line-height:1.7; color:var(--ink-80); margin-bottom:24px; }
  .ab-personal-text-col p:last-child{ margin-bottom:0; }
  .ab-personal-text-col strong{ font-weight:600; color:var(--ink); }
  .ab-personal-text-col em{ font-style:italic; color:var(--ink-80); }

  .ab-sticky-carousel{ flex:0 0 42%; position:sticky; top:120px; align-self:start; }
  .ab-carousel{ position:relative; border-radius:var(--r); overflow:hidden; }
  .ab-carousel-track{ position:relative; width:100%; aspect-ratio:3/4; }
  .ab-slide{ position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0; transition:opacity var(--t-slow) var(--ease); }
  .ab-slide.active{ opacity:1; }
  .ab-carousel-img{ width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; }

  /* ══ LOCATION BADGE (non-interactive caption chrome — white on dark blur) ══ */
  .ab-loc{
    position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:16px; z-index:2;
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px;
    padding:7px 13px 7px 11px; border-radius:var(--r-pill);
    background:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.5); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    font-family:var(--sans); font-size:var(--fs-label); font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.01em; color:var(--white);
  }
  .ab-loc-pin{ width:14px; height:14px; flex-shrink:0; }
  .ab-loc--bleed{ left:var(--gutter); bottom:48px; }
  .ab-carousel-controls{ position:absolute; bottom:16px; right:16px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; z-index:2; }
  .ab-carousel-btn{
    width:40px; height:40px; border-radius:var(--r-pill); border:none; padding:0;
    background:rgba(var(--ink-rgb),.5); backdrop-filter:blur(12px); -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
    color:var(--white); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; cursor:pointer;
    transition:background var(--t-fast) var(--ease), transform var(--t-fast) var(--ease);
  }
  .ab-carousel-btn:hover{ background:var(--red); transform:scale(1.08); }
  .ab-carousel-btn svg{ width:16px; height:16px; }

  /* ══ ENDING (light) — the full stop ══ */
  .ab-ending{ background:var(--paper); padding:var(--sp-sec-bot) var(--gutter); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
  .ab-ending-text{ font-family:var(--serif); font-size:var(--fs-serif-md); font-weight:500; font-style:italic; color:var(--ink); letter-spacing:.01em; text-align:center; }

  /* ══ SCROLL REVEAL ══ */
  .reveal, .reveal-child{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(24px); transition:opacity var(--t-reveal) var(--ease), transform var(--t-reveal) var(--ease); }
  .reveal.revealed, .reveal-child.revealed{ opacity:1; transform:none; }

  /* ══ RESPONSIVE — layout only; type clamps live in tokens ══ */
  @media (max-width:900px){
    .ab-hero{ padding-top:104px; }
    .ab-hero-inner{ flex-direction:column; gap:40px; align-items:flex-start; }
    .ab-hero-title{ margin-bottom:24px; }
    .ab-lens-inner{ flex-direction:column; gap:32px; }
    .ab-lens-aside{ position:static; flex:auto; }
    .ab-beliefs{ gap:40px; }
    .ab-belief-coda{ padding-top:48px; }
    .ab-photo{ width:240px; height:300px; }
    .ab-photo-col::before{ display:none; }
    .ab-pullquote{ margin:48px auto; }
    .ab-how-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px; }
    .ab-personal-split{ flex-direction:column; gap:40px; }
    .ab-sticky-carousel{ position:relative; top:0; order:-1; flex:none; width:100%; }
    .ab-carousel-track{ aspect-ratio:4/3; }
    .ab-bleed-img{ height:40vh; min-height:280px; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .reveal, .reveal-child{ opacity:1; transform:none; transition:none; }
    .pq-word{ opacity:1; transition:none; }
    .ab-belief-title{ color:var(--ink); -webkit-text-stroke-color:transparent; transition:none; }
    .ab-bleed-img img{ will-change:auto; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  /* ── Scroll reveal (production behaviour) ── */
  const io = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) { entry.target.classList.add('revealed'); io.unobserve(entry.target); }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.15, rootMargin: '0px 0px -40px 0px' });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el => io.observe(el));

  const sio = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
    entries.forEach(entry => {
      if (entry.isIntersecting) {
        entry.target.querySelectorAll('.reveal-child').forEach((child, i) => {
          (child as HTMLElement).style.transitionDelay = `${i * 80}ms`;
          child.classList.add('revealed');
        });
        sio.unobserve(entry.target);
      }
    });
  }, { threshold: 0.1 });
  document.querySelectorAll('.reveal-stagger').forEach(el => sio.observe(el));

  /* ── Pull quote — word by word ── */
  (function () {
    const pq = document.getElementById('pullquote');
    if (!pq) return;
    const words = pq.querySelectorAll('.pq-word');
    const pqio = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
      entries.forEach(entry => {
        if (entry.isIntersecting) {
          words.forEach((w, i) => setTimeout(() => w.classList.add('pq-visible'), i * 150));
          pqio.unobserve(entry.target);
        }
      });
    }, { threshold: 0.5 });
    pqio.observe(pq);
  })();

  /* ── Parallax on the full-bleed image ── */
  (function () {
    const wrap = document.getElementById('bleedImg');
    if (!wrap || window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) return;
    const img = wrap.querySelector('img');
    if (!img) return;
    window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
      const r = wrap.getBoundingClientRect();
      const vh = window.innerHeight;
      if (r.top < vh && r.bottom > 0) {
        const progress = (vh - r.top) / (vh + wrap.offsetHeight);
        img.style.transform = `translateY(${(progress - 0.5) * 60}px) scale(1.08)`;
      }
    }, { passive: true });
  })();

  /* ── Travel carousel — scroll-driven + arrows ── */
  (function () {
    const split = document.getElementById('travelSplit');
    const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.ab-slide');
    const prev = document.getElementById('carouselPrev');
    const next = document.getElementById('carouselNext');
    if (!split || !slides.length) return;
    const paragraphs = split.querySelectorAll('.ab-personal-text-col p');
    const total = slides.length;
    let current = 0;

    function setActive(idx: number) {
      idx = Math.max(0, Math.min(total - 1, idx));
      if (idx === current) return;
      slides[current].classList.remove('active');
      current = idx;
      slides[current].classList.add('active');
    }

    prev?.addEventListener('click', () => setActive(current - 1));
    next?.addEventListener('click', () => setActive(current + 1));

    if (paragraphs.length > 0) {
      // image 0 is the default; each paragraph advances by the count gap so
      // every image is reached on scroll even when paragraphs < images
      const offset = Math.max(0, total - paragraphs.length);
      const cio = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
        entries.forEach(e => {
          if (e.isIntersecting) {
            const i = Array.from(paragraphs).indexOf(e.target as HTMLParagraphElement);
            setActive(Math.min(i + offset, total - 1));
          }
        });
      }, { threshold: 0.6 });
      paragraphs.forEach(p => cio.observe(p));
    }
  })();

  if (window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    document.querySelectorAll('.pq-word').forEach(el => el.classList.add('pq-visible'));
  }
</script>

